WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.650
A hadith teaches that angels
were created from light.

2
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:05.400
Humans from clay.

3
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:07.780
The jinn from smokeless fire.

4
00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:12.380
Muslims believe humans and jinn
can choose to obey or disobey.

5
00:00:12.430 --> 00:00:13.760
Angels cannot.

6
00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:15.450
They always obey.

7
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:20.090
Some have famous tasks, such as bringing
the rain that makes the plants grow.

8
00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:24.840
So why would angels who cannot disobey
make any difference to how a Muslim lives

9
00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:25.800
today?

10
00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:29.920
In this mission, you'll meet
Jibril, Mika'il and other angels,

11
00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:32.390
and the work Muslims believe they do.

12
00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:36.820
Then you'll weigh up a claim: that belief
in angels makes little difference to

13
00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.670
how Muslims live today.

14
00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:43.810
Your mission: find out why belief in
obedient angels could shape a Muslim's daily

15
00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:44.430
life.
